    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if itll ever lift. it feels permanent. like no matter how much i try to relax or breathe or whatever people say, the noise never actually stops. it's like my brain is just stuck on high volume and there's no off switch. it just feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just... not be here. to just be completely gone so nothing can reach me anymore.",
